OL,3,GNEWSAHuge #2.2bn plan to transform
OL,4,ALadywood collapses
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build more than 10,000 homes
OL,7,Fas part of a #2.2bn project to
OL,8,Frevitalise a city centre neighbourhood
OL,9,Fhave collapsed.
OL,11,FBirmingham City Council said it had
OL,12,F"mutually agreed" to part ways with
OL,13,Fdevelopers Berkeley St Joseph after
OL,14,Frising costs had made the plans in
OL,15,FLadywood unviable.
OL,17,FThe scheme, for which a masterplan had
OL,18,Ftaken seven years to develop, included
OL,19,Fnew homes, improved transport links and
OL,20,Fmore green spaces.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
