OL,3,GNEWSAHuge #2.2bn plan to transform
OL,4,ALadywood collapses
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt had faced opposition from some
OL,7,Fresidents who last year told the BBC
OL,8,Fthey felt "confused" and "isolated"
OL,9,Fover a lack of "genuine consultation"
OL,10,Fwith the community.
